      "username": "M.Toseef",
      "name": "Muhammad Toseef",
      "created_at": "2025-07-14T11:09:46.102Z",
      "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>Yes, set “Process Attendance After”, this is the date after which auto attendance will start work.</li>\n<li>By default, ERPNext is running the schedular every hour, and you can also trigger manually by visiting the “Scheduled Job Type” doctyp and search for shift_type.process_auto_attendance_for_all_shifts, open this document and execute. You will see auto attendance would start…</li>\n</ol>",
