      "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:49:03.658Z",
      "cooked": "<p>All the processes have been run, and the status is displayed as “Completed”, but still the Attendance won’t get Marked Automatically.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/d/7d5654a0d7b0376d459ec4cf067bbdac9a8cb6a4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7d5654a0d7b0376d459ec4cf067bbdac9a8cb6a4\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-08-28 at 10.17.51 AM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7d5654a0d7b0376d459ec4cf067bbdac9a8cb6a4_2_690x459.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-08-28 at 10.17.51 AM\" data-base62-sha1=\"hSME447uo5EkwGlPutuMr9sJD0g\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7d5654a0d7b0376d459ec4cf067bbdac9a8cb6a4_2_690x459.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7d5654a0d7b0376d459ec4cf067bbdac9a8cb6a4_2_1035x688.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/d/7d5654a0d7b0376d459ec4cf067bbdac9a8cb6a4.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-08-28 at 10.17.51 AM</span><span class=\"informations\">1312×874 125 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
