    {
      "id": 479280,
      "username": "Geethanjali",
      "name": "Geethanjali",
      "created_at": "2025-08-28T10:14:57.749Z",
      "cooked": "<p>At the end of each month, I update the Process Attendance After Date to the first day of the month.<br>\nThen, in the Shift Type doctype, I use the “Mark Attendance” button under “Actions”.<br>\nWhen I click it, the system creates attendance records for the whole month based on the employees’ Check-ins.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/f/6f4ac711f96fe7d0ba28ea88ffe1340c67f5239c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6f4ac711f96fe7d0ba28ea88ffe1340c67f5239c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/f/6f4ac711f96fe7d0ba28ea88ffe1340c67f5239c_2_690x73.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fSxcZqhGTA8xJ6P58EjCykGhg16\" width=\"690\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/f/6f4ac711f96fe7d0ba28ea88ffe1340c67f5239c_2_690x73.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/f/6f4ac711f96fe7d0ba28ea88ffe1340c67f5239c_2_1035x109.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/f/6f4ac711f96fe7d0ba28ea88ffe1340c67f5239c_2_1380x146.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1711×183 17.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
