    {
      "id": 479286,
      "username": "ransikerandeni",
      "name": "Ransike Randeni",
      "created_at": "2025-08-28T10:32:11.144Z",
      "cooked": "<p>By default in the code, it doesn’t fetch the “Last Sync of Checkin” to current Time for Auto Attendance Marking. Even though the Functionality is provided. So the best approach is just to auto fill the “Last Sync of Checkin” daily at a specific time.</p>\n<p>You can check the code in apps &gt; hrms &gt; hrms &gt; hr &gt; doctype&gt; shift_type.py &gt; process_auto_attendance().</p>",
